comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-19T22:54:13.683Z",codex-agent,"Self-review reproduced unsafe pending merge replay. Added durable semantic revision bindings for source and destination, validate every pending receipt before planned writes, accept before/after publication states for exactly-once retry, and refuse stale, missing, archived or legacy receipt states while retaining evidence. Synthetic real-tracker regressions cover intervening native source and target edits."
  "2026-10-19T23:00:31.569Z",codex-agent,"Revert proof: restore only consolidate to the starting implementation, retain revision helpers and regression tests, then node --test --test-name-pattern=\"pending merge receipts\" test/review-r5.test.ts fails with the intended missing-refusal assertion. Fixed implementation preserves current source/target bodies and pending receipt bytes on refusal; unchanged before-publication and after-publication receipts remain retryable."
