body: "Source: resolved thread PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6t_o9_ on PR 1. The later maintainer comment reports an SDK-tracker reproduction after interruption between target publication and source cancellation. Code inspection at 325d45d confirms consolidate replays receipt.body without checking target or source content revisions. Preserve later acknowledged edits or refuse with a typed conflict while retaining the pending receipt. No private memory data was inspected; this follow-up records the resolved-thread concern separately from the current unresolved-thread fixes."
